                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Versblue is a standout spot for creative Taiwanese inspired drinks, especially their coffee and tea based cocktails. The Lemontart was my favorite, bright, smooth, and perfectly balanced, and it really shows how much craft they put into it. Their cocktails are unique and the space is cozy and stylish with a relaxed vibe, and the bartenders are friendly and knowledgeable. A must go to stop for locals and visitors!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
