                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Versblue Taipei – Café by day, bar by night.\nA nice place to escape the hot weather during the day if you’re around The Red House in Ximen. I personally had a really good impression of this place, even though I only stopped by for a short time during the day. It was weekdays \u0026 my last day in Taiwan before heading back to Thailand, so the place wasn’t busy at that time. Still, Luke (the owner) was super kind, friendly, and made me feel very welcome. The vibe was really chill and relaxing — such a nice little spot!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
